#: ../../troubleshooting.md:1 b3addcd946cc4241ad9e7c901c80e916
msgid "When something goes wrong"
msgstr "出狀況的時候"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:3 46c623d6e9ed403d805cd703b234b38e
msgid "The socket will not open"
msgstr "連線打不開"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:5 54aced22a1ea41ed95321bd3cec52da4
msgid "The browser tells a page nothing about a failed WebSocket handshake — no status, no reason — so the app asks the service over plain HTTP instead and reports what it finds."
msgstr "瀏覽器不會把失敗的 WebSocket 交握細節告訴網頁——沒有狀態碼、沒有原因——因此應用程式改以一般 HTTP 去問服務，再回報它問到的結果。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:9 668b7c1b9a4348fa82b7d1d74ed90d26
msgid "**Nothing answering.** The service is not running, or is not where this app is looking. Start it, or set `VITE_WS_URL`."
msgstr "**沒有人回應。**服務沒在跑，或不在應用程式尋找的位置。啟動它，或設定 `VITE_WS_URL`。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:12 ea56cf06376a4a2b9a14ea167eca1b55
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Running, but refusing this page.** The service is up and turned this page away, which is almost always the origin allowlist. Start it with `--allow-origin <the origin this app is served from>`. See {doc}`getting-started`."
msgstr "**在跑，但拒絕這個頁面。**服務是活的，而且把這個頁面擋下來了，幾乎總是來源白名單的緣故。以 `--allow-origin <本應用程式所在的來源>` 啟動它。見 {doc}`getting-started`。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:16 d7f50f78dd764c4b9bb2dba3ad0f4f90
msgid "You can ask the same question by hand:"
msgstr "你也可以手動問同一個問題："

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:22 dc9a63731c1046e69c3dcd4f2d1b57e3
msgid "It answers JSON carrying the QuantLib version the binary linked, its uptime, and how many connections and sessions are open. A reply proves the service's loop is turning; it says nothing about whether a particular graph is healthy, which is the honest scope of a liveness check."
msgstr "它回覆的 JSON 帶著這個執行檔連結的 QuantLib 版本、執行時間，以及目前開了幾條連線與幾個工作階段。有回覆就證明服務的事件迴圈還在轉；它不說明某一份物件圖是否健康，而那正是存活檢查誠實的適用範圍。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:27 a139ac56c828455fb411269f6fe41e7d
msgid "\"Overloaded\" when opening a session"
msgstr "開啟工作階段時出現「過載」"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:29 5f64128fec4041aa8981924e13ed9c2b
msgid "A socket may hold only so many sessions — sixteen — and the service serves 32 sockets at once. Past the limit, opening a session is refused as overloaded, and the remedy is to **close a tab**, not to retry: a session is a live QuantLib graph holding a worker seat, so retrying is not what frees one."
msgstr "一條連線最多只能持有這麼多工作階段——十六個——而服務同時服務 32 條連線。超過上限後，開啟工作階段會以過載被拒絕，解法是**關掉一個分頁**而不是重試：工作階段是佔著工作者席位的 QuantLib 即時物件圖，重試並不會空出席位。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:34 5dcb76fc7c1544f49dcb37d0bdbb4cb1
msgid "The connection dropped — what happens to my session?"
msgstr "連線斷了——我的工作階段會怎樣？"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:36 4d25e7b69f0343dfb4d3813b7487a455
msgid "One of two things, and the status bar says which."
msgstr "兩種情況之一，而狀態列會說是哪一種。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:38 d09aebb78ebc48da9f795076f657ed4d
msgid "**socket lost — session held**, then **resumed**. The service kept the session, its graph and anything running in it for its grace window (a minute by default), and the app took it back: same id, same graph, and a calculation that was in flight delivers its result rather than being lost."
msgstr "**socket lost — session held**，接著 **resumed**。服務在寬限期內（預設一分鐘）保留了工作階段、它的物件圖，以及其中正在跑的一切，而應用程式把它接了回來：同一個代號、同一份物件圖，飛在半路的計算會送出它的結果，而不是消失。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:43 48b1212ae7914d77a68015bbcbeff773
msgid "**A new session id, and a bootstrap in the session pane.** The window had passed, or the service was restarted — either way it remembers nothing, so the app replayed the workbook into a new session and repriced. Nothing is lost except the calculation that was running, because the client owns the document."
msgstr "**一個新的工作階段代號，以及工作階段面板上的一次建構耗時。**寬限期已過，或服務被重新啟動過——無論哪一種，它什麼都不記得，因此應用程式把工作簿重播成一個新的工作階段並重新計價。除了當時正在跑的那段計算之外沒有損失，因為文件由用戶端擁有。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:48 ccd52f409dd94292bbdcdc016202ec9e
#, python-brace-format
msgid "A request that was in flight during the drop is held while there is a chance of an answer, and fails as \"the socket went\" once there is not. See {doc}`interface`."
msgstr "斷線期間飛在半路的請求，在還有機會拿到答案時會被保留，一旦沒有機會了就以「連線斷了」失敗。見 {doc}`interface`。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:52 b2dd9766f3ec4407a865177633567cde
msgid "A field turned red"
msgstr "某個欄位變紅了"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:54 31aff31aedab4574b9eb802f5999161e
msgid "Rejections land on the control that produced them, and three kinds read differently:"
msgstr "拒絕會落在產生它的那個控制項上，而三種讀法各不相同："

#: ../../troubleshooting.md 72cefc509a9c4134962519687a451923
msgid "Reads as"
msgstr "讀起來像"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md 75ce8132a56d47d1b9f1bc0fa4b84ed2
msgid "Code"
msgstr "錯誤碼"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md 9ca2058d3071422aa39afd212a5f5ddd
msgid "What to do"
msgstr "該怎麼做"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md ce0d7d767b8343beaa54a87fe8409eac
msgid "*fill this in*"
msgstr "*把這格填起來*"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md 4ba22c3ef9c741c497d3e77372d439f9
msgid "unspecified enum"
msgstr "未指定的列舉"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md 1f4252c078824b5bbf0cc66d76be36a4
msgid "A required convention was left empty. Nothing defaults silently, on purpose"
msgstr "有一項必填的慣例被留空。刻意不讓任何東西靜默採用預設值"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md d8a9201a3c78463097264560f05089dd
msgid "*this value cannot work*"
msgstr "*這個值行不通*"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md 88228b6e3a094619bdc68ba5298d685d
msgid "invalid argument"
msgstr "無效參數"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md dec986b380f44611915d55d47aeb19aa
msgid "The field is set to something the maths or the schema refuses — an expiry before the evaluation date, a lower barrier above the upper"
msgstr "欄位被設成數學或結構描述所拒絕的值——到期日早於評價日、下障礙高於上障礙"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md 8aaafc32829c46cb9849c3af1bca4ae3
msgid "*this build does not price it*"
msgstr "*這個版本不計價它*"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md c86ac3d8a9314804b93bc9bc40c64092
msgid "unsupported"
msgstr "不支援"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md 67d8444f650d44af9751dc7a325fd896
msgid "The request is well-formed and this build refuses to price it on a substitute"
msgstr "請求格式完全正確，而這個版本拒絕用替代方案為它計價"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md eba679fb08a14d35adcdcaabb0da8858
msgid "*unknown id*"
msgstr "*未知的代號*"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md fdbfc6facc18426c827c5a31f0aeb751
msgid "unknown id"
msgstr "未知代號"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md 6c84ce65d74d4ee88aaaada3bcdf5c55
msgid "A quote, curve or index id that is not in this session — usually an object renamed after something else named it"
msgstr "某個報價、曲線或利率指標的代號不在這個工作階段中——通常是某個物件在被別人引用之後又改了名"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:64 a32cb4bb050a4f3bb67d98555e675529
msgid "`BOOTSTRAP_FAILED` means the curve did not strip: check the pillars for a crossing or an impossible quote. `CALCULATION_FAILED` carries no field, because it is not a field's fault — the maths failed on inputs that were each individually legal."
msgstr "`BOOTSTRAP_FAILED` 代表曲線沒能拔靴建構出來：檢查支點是否交叉，或是否有不可能的報價。`CALCULATION_FAILED` 不帶欄位，因為那不是某個欄位的錯——是數學在各自單獨看都合法的輸入上失敗了。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:69 9948b992f4c64367b217c1eeb5e6d4e6
msgid "The price did not move when I dragged a slider"
msgstr "我拖了滑桿，價格卻沒動"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:71 cafd0ee8134e4cf18836465b390261bf
msgid "Two known reasons, both of which the interface marks:"
msgstr "兩個已知原因，介面對兩者都有標示："

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:73 ec99c3df2d824b779ef93414fe8ae859
msgid "**The quote is a fixed leg's rate**, drawn in amber with its slider disabled. QuantLib's fixed-rate leg takes a value rather than a handle, so the rate is read once at construction. Price the trade again."
msgstr "**該報價是固定腳的利率**，以琥珀色顯示且滑桿停用。QuantLib 的固定利率腳取的是值而不是控點，因此利率在建構時只讀取一次。請重新為交易計價。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:76 698c63b180d8421c8f910b9541ddb867
msgid "**The edit was structural, not live.** A curve shape or the evaluation date cannot be written into a running graph. The amber bar at the top of the market pane says the structure changed and offers the rebuild, with the last bootstrap's cost in milliseconds."
msgstr "**這次編輯是結構性的，不是即時的。**曲線形狀或評價日無法寫進執行中的物件圖。市場面板上方的琥珀色橫幅會說明結構已改變並提供重建，附上上次建構以毫秒計的成本。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:81 e2c534b08b6c4fb2bb6b23b5b9565520
msgid "A result row says \"not supplied\""
msgstr "某一列結果寫著「未提供」"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:83 380f0836d2f54cf7be2456701fd832a1
msgid "The engine that ran does not publish that quantity — the American approximations publish almost no greeks, and the binomial engine has no vega. It is not zero, and the service names the absence rather than leaving a hole. Price it on an analytic engine if you need that greek, and remember that the two numbers are then from different engines, which is what the engine echo on the face of the result is for."
msgstr "實際執行的引擎不發布那個量——美式近似法幾乎不發布任何希臘字母，二元樹引擎則沒有 vega。它不是零，而服務會指名這個缺席，而不是留下一個洞。如果你需要那個希臘字母，就改用解析解引擎計價；並記得那時兩個數字來自不同的引擎，而這正是結果正面那個引擎回音的用途。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:90 477b439fd9a24310b1fcd5ccebe8d856
msgid "The same trade gives two different Monte Carlo prices"
msgstr "同一筆交易給出兩個不同的蒙地卡羅價格"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:92 b9609942a3a1442e90b645d77a565daa
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Expected, and the reason is in {doc}`engines`: batching draws from the random number stream differently from one run of the same total. Reproducibility keys on the triple (seed, samples, batch size). Compare like with like by reading the engine echo on each result."
msgstr "這在預期之內，理由在 {doc}`engines`：分批從亂數流中取值的方式，和同樣總量的一次跑並不相同。可重現性繫於（種子、樣本數、批次大小）這個三元組。讀每個結果上的引擎回音，拿同類去比同類。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:97 a572400cb8ff4b97ae4eaf355392fb20
msgid "A capability badge appeared in the status bar"
msgstr "狀態列出現了一個能力徽章"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:99 1ef6964349e74795852c813a5fe92ade
msgid "The service's `Capabilities` answer disagrees with the tables this build of the app gates its controls on. That means one side has moved — usually a service rebuilt with a new style or result kind. The app keeps working against what it knows; the badge is there so a stale capability is not something you discover by meeting an unexplained rejection."
msgstr "服務的 `Capabilities` 回覆，和這個版本的應用程式用來管控控制項的表格不一致。這代表其中一邊動了——通常是服務重新建置後多了新的類型或結果種類。應用程式仍依它所知的內容運作；徽章存在的意義，是讓過期的能力不必等到你撞上一個無法解釋的拒絕才被發現。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:105 32074cfae7074907b8918a1a1fa1c1fa
msgid "A finite-difference price wobbles as I refine the grid"
msgstr "我加細網格，有限差分價格卻上下擺盪"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:107 7189bc987c874a7f80a50a07d461d372
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Two usual causes. If the trade is a barrier, the barrier is probably falling between grid lines — move the asset steps until it lands on one. Otherwise it is the oscillation a Crank-Nicolson-family scheme shows against the kink in the payoff, and a few **damping steps** are the fix: they take the first few time steps fully implicit. See {doc}`engines`."
msgstr "兩個常見原因。如果是障礙商品，障礙多半落在格線之間——調整資產步數直到它落在格線上。否則就是 Crank-Nicolson 家族格式在收益函數轉折處出現的震盪，而幾個**阻尼步數**就是解法：它們把最前面幾個時間步改成全隱式。見 {doc}`engines`。"

